tion":{"start":{"line":17,"column":11,"offset":938},"end":{"line":17,"column":58,"offset":985},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","id":"notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":11,"offset":1109},"end":{"line":20,"column":58,"offset":1156},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","id":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":11,"offset":1297},"end":{"line":19,"column":58,"offset":1344},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","id":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":11,"offset":839},"end":{"line":16,"column":58,"offset":886},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-investment","id":"notes.psychology.social-investment","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":11,"offset":816},"end":{"line":15,"column":58,"offset":863},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}],"anchors":{"social-maturity-and-narcissism-reduction":{"type":"header","text":"Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction","value":"social-maturity-and-narcissism-reduction","line":16,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-thesis":{"type":"header","text":"Core Thesis","value":"core-thesis","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-process-of-ego-correction":{"type":"header","text":"The Process of Ego Correction","value":"the-process-of-ego-correction","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-maturity-formula":{"type":"header","text":"The Maturity Formula","value":"the-maturity-formula","line":31,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"social-maturity-and-narcissism-reduction\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#social-maturity-and-narcissism-reduction\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"social-maturity-and-narcissism-reduction-1\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#social-maturity-and-narcissism-reduction-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-thesis\">Core Thesis<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-thesis\"></a></h2>\n<p>Narsisme cenderung dominan pada masa kanak-kanak dan remaja karena dunia dipahami secara <em>self-centered</em>. Kedewasaan bukan sekadar bertambahnya usia, melainkan kemampuan membiarkan realitas mengoreksi ego.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Narsisme turun bukan karena orang makin tua, tapi karena orang dipaksa belajar bahwa dirinya bukan pusat sistem.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"the-process-of-ego-correction\">The Process of Ego Correction<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-process-of-ego-correction\"></a></h2>\n<p>Kedewasaan terjadi ketika fantasi diri \"bertabrakan\" dengan kebutuhan orang lain dan realitas objektif. Jika tabrakan ini diproses secara sehat, narsisme akan berkurang melalui empat mekanisme utama:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Social Investment</strong>: Mengambil peran sosial (pasangan, orang tua, pekerja, leader) yang memaksa individu beradaptasi dengan kebutuhan orang lain.</li>\n<li><strong>Social Emotional Stability</strong>: Kemampuan mengelola emosi agar tidak menjadi reaksi defensif, hinaan, atau drama.</li>\n<li><strong>Adaptive Learning (vs Maladaptive Memory)</strong>: Mengubah kegagalan menjadi data untuk perbaikan, bukan menjadi bukti identitas luka.</li>\n<li><strong>Reality Check</strong>: Membandingkan fantasi diri dengan kondisi aktual dan output nyata.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"the-maturity-formula\">The Maturity Formula<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-maturity-formula\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>Ego Dewasa</strong> = (Peran Sosial <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>) + (Stabilitas Emosi <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>) + (Pembelajaran dari Gagal <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>) + (Koreksi Realitas <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>)</p>\n<p>Sebaliknya, narsisme menetap ketika peran sosial dihindari, emosi dibiarkan reaktif, kegagalan dijadikan identitas luka, dan fantasi dilindungi dari realitas.</p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-investment\">Social Investment</a>, <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability\">Social Emotional Stability</a>, <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory\">Maladaptive Memory vs Adaptive Learning</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">maturity (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">social-development (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.agency-gap-pipeline\">Agency Gap and Public Contribution Pipeline</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.biological-social-pattern-fixing\">Biological and Social Factors in Pattern Fixing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework\">Biopsychosocial-Cultural-Spiritual Framework</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.digital-media-vs-maturity\">Digital Media vs Social Maturity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.maladaptive-memory\">Maladaptive Memory vs Adaptive Learning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents\">Recurring Patterns vs Incidents</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability\">Social Emotional Stability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-investment\">Social Investment</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enableFrontmatterTags":true,"enableHashesForFMTags":false,"enablePrett